description:
Encodes text to UTF-8 binary or hex bytes, or decodes binary/hex back to text with strict UTF-8 validation (bad byte sequences are rejected, not replaced). The page at redbison.dev/binary-text-converter shows both directions live.

Returns: Text: the encoded bytes or decoded text. structuredContent { output, mode }.
Example input: {"input":"Hi","mode":"textToBinary"}
